<title>UK: Front month Brent trades at seven-month low.</title>
<headline>Front month Brent trades at seven-month low.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Front month IPE Brent crude futures traded on Friday at $18.80 a barrel, the lowest level in seven months.</p>
<p>The April contract on the International Petroleum Exchange (IPE) traded at $18.80 a barrel, the lowest level since August 1 when the front month contract hit a low of $18.79. -- London newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
</text>
